<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβᾰρ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>behave</i> or <i>speak like a barbarian,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				1.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.6.5
			</span></i>; <i>speak broken Greek, speak gibberish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				175d
			</span></i> codd. (sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βατταρίζων</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; βαρβαριζόντων ἑτεροφώνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.</u>
					994.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>violate the laws of speech, commit barbarisms,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ λέξει β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>SE</u>
					165b21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				39.1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.2.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>, etc.; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σολοικίζω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.154
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans., <i>'murder',
				mangle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Ῥωμαίων φωνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>side with the barbarians,</i> i.e. <i>the Persians,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				4.2
			</span></i>.</div>
